%% frame: UC3 B5 to B7: create the START purchase intent (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Svc as :PaymentBrowserService
    participant App as :PurchaseIntentAppService
    participant Users as :UserAppService
    participant Repo as :PurchaseIntentRepository
    participant Cat as :CatalogPurchaseSupport
    participant Uuid as UuidV7
    create participant Intent as :PurchaseIntent

    Note over Svc,App: B5: request, CSRF check and controller as in @fig-a-uc04-ds-intent; no rate limit for START
    critical intent transaction, REQUIRED, READ COMMITTED, 10 s
        Svc->>App: createIntent(user, "START", productId, null, quoteId)
        App->>Users: requireActive(user)
        break identity-svc unreachable (E2)
            Users-->>App: IdentityUnavailableException
            App-->>Svc: exception: transaction rolled back
        end
        App->>Repo: currentTime()
        Repo-->>App: now
        App->>App: start(user, productId, quoteId, now)
        Note over App,Cat: B6: catalog takes lock 6, the product row, and checks the listing and the quote (@tbl-a-uc03-ops)
        alt quoteId given (B6)
            App->>Cat: lockQuotedStart(productId, quoteId, user)
        else no quote, API callers only (A1)
            App->>Cat: lockStartQuote(productId, now)
        end
        break listing cannot start a team, or quote refused (A3)
            Cat-->>App: BizException
            App-->>Svc: BizException: rolled back, "Get a new price"
        end
        Cat-->>App: StartQuote
        Note over App,Intent: B7: reserve the id of the team that does not exist yet
        App->>Uuid: next()
        Uuid-->>App: dealId
        App->>Intent: «create» issue(terms, now + 2400 s, now + lifetimeSeconds, now)
        App->>Repo: save(intent)
        Repo-->>App: PurchaseIntent
        App-->>Svc: intentId
    end
    Note over Svc,App: B8: the controller returns the intent id; Pay upfront follows (@sec-a-pay-upfront)
